Follow [the shared-update and release contract](../../docs/WORKSTREAMS.md#shared-update-and-release-contract).
For a change that benefits both variants, use shared code where practical,
verify both entry points and record any device checks still pending.
For a coordinated release, use a shared version name and distinct Play
version codes. Honor each platform's UI and release constraints.
